From: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 1 Feb 2026 23:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] security(bolt-ui): move API keys to server-only context

BREAKING CHANGE: API keys are no longer exposed in client bundle.
All LLM API calls must now be proxied through server routes.

Fixes critical security issue where API keys were bundled in
client JavaScript and could be extracted by malicious actors.

Changes:
- Remove non-public envPrefix from vite.config.ts
- Create /api/config/public for non-sensitive URLs
- Add bundle scanning test to prevent future regressions
- Update documentation

SECURITY: Prevents API key theft and unauthorized usage
Impact: Requires client code migration to use server proxies

