+### Security Note: API Keys
+
+⚠️ **IMPORTANT**: API keys are handled server-side only and are NEVER exposed to the client bundle.
+
+If you need to access configuration from the client:
+
+```typescript
+// ❌ WRONG - process.env not available in client
+const url = process.env.OLLAMA_API_BASE_URL;
+
+// ✅ CORRECT - Use public config endpoint
+const config = await fetch('/api/config/public').then(r => r.json());
+const url = config.ollama.baseUrl;
+```
